</para>
<title>Factoring Trinomials Using Substitution</title>
<para>Sometimes a trinomial does not appear to be in the \(ax^2 + bx + c\) form. However, we can often make a thoughtful substitution that will allow us to make it fit the \(ax^2 + bx + c\) form. This is called factoring by substitution. It is standard to use \(u\) for the substitution.</para>
<para>In the form \(ax^2 + bx + c\), the middle term has a variable, \(x\), and its square, \(x^2\), is the variable part of the first term. Look for this relationship as you try to find a substitution.</para>
<para><emphasis>Example 2</emphasis></para>
<para>Factor by substitution: \(x^4 − 4x^2 − 5\).</para>
<para>The variable part of the middle term is \(x^2\), and its square, \(x^4\), is the variable part of the first term. (We know \((x^2)^2 = x^4)\). If we let \(u = x^2\), we can put our trinomial in the \(ax^2 + bx + c\) form we need to factor it.</para>
<para><emphasis>Step 1 - 
  </emphasis>Rewrite the trinomial to prepare for the substitution.</para>
<para>  \(({\style{color:red}x}^{\style{color:red}2})^2-4({\style{color:red}x}^{\style{color:red}2})-5\)</para>
<para><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> Let \(u=x^2\) and substitute.</para>
<para>  \({\style{color:red}u}^2-4{\style{color:red}u}-5\) </para>
<para><emphasis>Step 3 - 
  </emphasis>Factor the trinomial.</para>
<para>  \((u +1)(u-5)\)</para>
<para><emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> Replace \(u\) with \(x^2\).</para>
<para>  \(({\style{color:red}x}^{\style{color:red}2}+1)({\style{color:red}x}^{\style{color:red}2}-5)\) </para>
<para><emphasis>Step 5 - 
  </emphasis>Check:</para>
<para>
  <m:math display="inline">
    <m:semantics>
      <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mspace width="3em"/>
          <m:mtable>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mtd>
            </m:mtr>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
              </m:mtd>
            </m:mtr>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                <m:mo>&amp;checkmark;</m:mo>
              </m:mtd>
            </m:mtr>
          </m:mtable>
        </m:mrow>
      </m:mrow>
      <m:annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content">
        <m:mrow>
          <m:mspace width="3em"/>
          <m:mtable>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>(</m:mo>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                  <m:mo>)</m:mo>
                </m:mrow>
              </m:mtd>
            </m:mtr>
            <m:mtr>
              <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
